 nests too deep for D1) (#10171)

Refs #10164 (MIGRATION-APPLY-FAILED-1:
2026-11-10-ultrastable-product.sql).

Statement 2, the `owner_asks_product_au` trigger that inserts into
`agent_issues`, nests past D1's trigger limit (D1 HTTP 400 "triggers
nested too deep"), so the file stopped after two statements and the
view, four owner cards and the P1-P4 roadmap issues never applied. The
trigger is removed; `v_product_answers_unfiled` plus a new #P0 roadmap
issue (code-task `scripts/remediation_consumer.py`, code-probe on
`v_product_answers_unfiled`) carry an answer into the record by sweep.
The file is edited in place because the failed run never recorded it as
applied.

